  m_text: 'Avia Stalker is an addictive game in which the player plays the role of
    an aircraft repairman. He must control a team of repairmen, select the correct
    parts of the plane to repair and quickly click on the areas that will appear
    after selection. If the player makes the wrong choice, their hearts will decrease.
    The player must be careful and not make mistakes, otherwise the planes will become
    unflyable and the player will lose.       '
